mprove the final release. If you want to help shape the game, you can fill it out here: https://tally","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T14:06:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721198969","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3989890-1833968530892360","game_id":"steam-3989890","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is now available!","summary":"📢 The demo is available!Hello everyone,After quite a bit of work, the game's demo is finally available for download on Steam!What's included:The complete introduction to the story and the first 4 days.A first look at the different girl routes.Side quests and secrets to discover.Your feedback is precious for the rest of development. Feel free to share your thoughts or report bugs on the Community Hub.Thank you for your support and have fun playing!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T21:40:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530892360","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3989890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:34Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3989890":"2026-10-26T01:02:34Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3989890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4094320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3989890","app_id":3989890,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:26Z","source_url":"https://api.steampower